税负就越低。财税[2012]85号文主要内容如下：": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:640543036", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/98005X/201303/44967904.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306554037", "display_name": "涉外税务", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "涉外税务", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W967543061", "doi": null, "title": "完善对利息、股息、红利的征税", "publication_date": "1998-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5009699386", "display_name": "林素贞", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "林素贞", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"完善对利息、股息、红利的征税□林素贞随着市场经济的培育和发展，利息、股息、红利所得将普遍存在：有减免税企业个人股东取得的红利收入；从事种植业、养殖业、饲养业承包者、合伙人的承包红利收入；企事业单位支付个人集资的利息、股息收入；农村基金会支付股东的股息...": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:967543061", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/80363X/199808/67074838780846009.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306556147", "display_name": "福建税务", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "福建税务", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W2319320043", "doi": null, "title": "股利税“减半”的市场反应研究——基于财税[2005]102的事件研究", "publication_date": "2013-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5049331774", "display_name": "杨宝", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "杨宝", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "last", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5087895305", "display_name": "袁天荣", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "袁天荣", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"以2005年6月13日财政部、国家税务总局联合颁布实施《关于股息红利个人所得税有关政策的通知》（财税[2005]102号）将个人投资者股利所得税“减半征收”为研究背景，考察我国2005年股利税削减的市场反应。研究发现，2005年股利税“减半征收”政策发布期间，资本市场整体呈现出“期望一失望”的反应过程。进一步研究还发现，预期派现倾向高、预期派现能力强的上市公司对于股利税“减半征收”政策的市场反应更加积极；但市场流通股对于股利税“减半征收”政策的反应较为“平淡”。这说明我国2005年红利税削减政策的政策初衷、调整幅度并未能很好地契合资本市场的“预期”。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:2319320043", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/96458A/201306/47592240.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S2764946372", "display_name": "Shuiwu yu jingji", "issn_l": "1004-9339", "issn": ["1004-9339"], "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "税务与经济", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W2516320605", "doi": null, "title": "个人取得的哪些“其他所得”应当征收个人所得税", "publication_date": "2013-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5089156706", "display_name": "纪宏奎", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "纪宏奎", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"问：根据《中华人民共和国个人所得税法》（主席令第48号）第二条的规定,对个人取得的下列各项个人所得,应纳个人所得税：一、工资、薪金所得;二、个体工商户的生产、经营所得;三、对企事业单位的承包经营、承租经营所得;四、劳务报酬所得;五、稿酬所得;六、特许权使用费所得;七、利息、股息、红利所得;八、财产租赁所得;九、财产转让所得;十、偶然所得;十一、经国务院财政部门确定征税的其他所得.请问,“国务院财政部门确定征税的其他所得”具体包括哪些内容？": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:2516320605", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/70617X/201309/668686958.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306556870", "display_name": "纳税", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "纳税", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W999949573", "doi": null, "title": "股利所得不应纳入“年所得”申报范畴", "publication_date": "2007-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5076046455", "display_name": "黄建中", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "黄建中", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"2006年11月8日，国税总局发布的《个人所得税自行纳税申报办法（试行）》，明确了年所得12万元以上的纳税人须向税务机关自行申报纳税的5种情形，其中需申报的“年所得”包含工资、稿酬所得、财产转让所得、特许权使用费所得、利息、股息、红利所得等11项个人所得税法规定的应税所得项目。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:999949573", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/80519A/200705/24984122.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306558546", "display_name": "财会月刊：会计版", "issn_l": nu